@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

# HTTP requests file for Visual Studio 2022 (17.8+), VS Code (REST Client extension), or Rider.
# Arquivo de requisições HTTP para Visual Studio 2022 (17.8+), VS Code (extensão REST Client) ou Rider.
#
# Click "Send request" above each block. Run in order: later blocks depend on earlier responses.
# Clique em "Send request" acima de cada bloco. Execute na ordem: os blocos finais usam o resultado dos anteriores.
#
# Note: Block 3 registers PR-ZZZ; running it again returns 409 (RN6). This is expected.
# Obs.: o bloco 3 cadastra a matrícula PR-ZZZ; se rodar novamente, receberá 409 (RN6). Isso é esperado.

### 1. Dashboard summary / Resumo do painel (expected / esperado: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary

### 2. List aircraft / Listar aeronaves (expected / esperado: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/aircraft

### 3. Register aircraft / Cadastrar aeronave (expected / esperado: 201, status Operational)
# @name createAircraft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/aircraft
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "registration": "PR-ZZZ",
  "model": "E175",
  "flightHours": 100
}

### 4. Register duplicate registration / Cadastrar a mesma matrícula (expected / esperado: 409, RN6)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/aircraft
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "registration": "PR-ZZZ",
  "model": "E175",
  "flightHours": 100
}

### 5. Invalid registration format / Matrícula fora do formato (expected / esperado: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/aircraft
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "registration": "abc",
  "model": "E175",
  "flightHours": 0
}

### 6. Create overdue inspection / Registrar inspeção com prazo vencido (expected / esperado: 201, Pending, isOverdue true)
# @name createInspection
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aircraftId": {{createAircraft.response.body.$.id}},
  "type": "A-Check",
  "description": "Inspeção de 600 horas",
  "dueDate": "2020-01-01"
}

### 7. Skip directly to Completed / Pular direto para Completed (expected / esperado: 400, RN2)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/inspections/{{createInspection.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completed" }

### 8. Start inspection / Iniciar a inspeção (expected / esperado: 200, InProgress; aircraft becomes InMaintenance / aeronave passa a InMaintenance, RN3)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/inspections/{{createInspection.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### 9. Check aircraft status / Conferir a aeronave (expected / esperado: PR-ZZZ with status / com status InMaintenance)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/aircraft

### 10. Complete inspection / Concluir a inspeção (expected / esperado: 200, Completed, isOverdue false; aircraft returns to Operational / aeronave volta a Operational, RN4)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/inspections/{{createInspection.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completed" }

### 11. Filter completed inspections / Filtrar inspeções concluídas (expected / esperado: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inspections?status=Completed

### 12. Invalid status filter / Status inválido no filtro (expected / esperado: 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inspections?status=Qualquer